-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Yaffe</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Automated analysis of mammographic densities</article-title><source>Phys Med Biol</source><year>1996a</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>909</fpage><lpage>923</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Phys Med Biol||41|909||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8735257</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Byng</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Boyd</surname><given-names>NF</given-names></name><name><surname>Little</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Symmetry of projection in the quantitative analysis of mammographic images</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer Prev</source><year>1996b</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>319</fpage><lpage>327</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Eur J Cancer Prev||5|319||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8972250</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Byrne</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Colditz</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Willet</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Speizer</surname><given-names>FE</given-names></name><name><surname>Pollak</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hankinson</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plasma insulin-like growth factor (IGF) I, IGF-binding Protein 3, and mammographic density</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>2000</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>3744</fpage><lpage>3748</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||60|3744||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10919644</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Byrne</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Schairer</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolfe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Parekh</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Salane</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Brinton</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoover</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Haile</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mammographic features and breast cancer risk: Effects with time, age, and menopause status</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1995</year><volume>87</volume><fpage>1622</fpage><lpage>1629</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||87|1622||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7563205</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cara</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenfield</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Furlanetto</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A longitudinal study of the relationship of plasma somatomedin-C concentration to the pubertal growth spurt</article-title><source>Am J Dis Child</source><year>1987</year><volume>141</volume><fpage>562</fpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Am J Dis Child||141|562||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3578171</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cauley</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Lucas</surname><given-names>FL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuller</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name><name><surname>Stone</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Browner</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Cummings</su